  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds multi-country compatibility validation (--bc-country de,us,w1 with --max-parallel-countries).\n      Validates every selected app from current source even without a baseline, and classifies apps and tests from AL source for init and validation.\n      CHANGELOG.md contains the complete details.",
